        // the current owner call transferOwnership. Since owner is zero, no one can call onlyOwner. Therefore,
        // we instead make the reference assumption that the contract's owner has been set to address(this) by
        // exploiting that tests can call c.transferOwnership only if current owner == address(this). To initialize
